OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy at
OL,6,Ffirst with some heavy showers across
OL,7,Fthe Lothians and eastern Borders,
OL,8,Fthese fading out through the evening.
OL,9,FMostly dry overnight but the odd light
OL,10,Fshower possible over Dumfries and
OL,11,FGalloway.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FDry in the east with some
OL,14,Fbright or sunny spells, cloudier with
OL,15,Fa few light showers in the west. More
OL,16,Fpersistent rain will spread into the
OL,17,Fwest later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
